# My CxOne Tool

Built with the [Checkmarx One Go SDK](https://github.com/cx-andrew-gehring/cxone-sdk-golang).

## Usage

```sh
export CX_TENANT=your-tenant CX_API_KEY=your-key CX_REGION=US
go run .
```

## Development

See [.devenv/README.md](.devenv/README.md) for development environment setup and commit conventions.
